= The Library

This library is in transition. The player party, approved population and opening-party models, three internal PPS factions, PPS adviser pool, and PPS self-defence organization are implemented. The government, most other organizations, most cards, and dated events remain the temporary German baseline.

@menu

- @government: Germany's system of government
- @weimar_timeline: Timeline of the Weimar Republic before 1928
- @curr_gov: Current government details
